{
  "name": "[SUB] Image Quality Checker - BPP Check",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Gelen parametreleri al\nconst input = items[0].json;\n\n// Zorunlu: directory\nif (!input.directory) {\n  throw new Error('directory parametresi zorunlu!');\n}\n\nconst config = {\n  directory: input.directory,\n  limit: input.limit || 0\n};\n\nreturn [{ json: config }];"
      },
      "id": "config-node",
      "name": "Build Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [460, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8101/bpp/directory",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-bpp",
      "name": "BPP Check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [680, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "results",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "split-results",
      "name": "Split Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [900, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "condition-compressed",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.is_over_compressed }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filter-compressed",
      "name": "Filter Over-Compressed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1120, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "condition-ok",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filter-ok",
      "name": "Filter OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1120, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## [SUB] BPP Check\n\n**Giriş Parametreleri:**\n```json\n{\n  \"directory\": \"/path/to/images\",\n  \"limit\": 0\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Zorunlu:\n- `directory`: Klasör yolu\n\n### Opsiyonel:\n- `limit`: Max dosya (0=all)\n\n---\n\n### Metod:\nBytes Per Pixel\n\nbpp = file_size / total_pixels\n\nDüşük BPP = aşırı sıkıştırılmış\nYüksek BPP = iyi kalite",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 260
      },
      "id": "sticky-input",
      "name": "Sticky Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Response\n\n| Alan | Açıklama |\n|------|----------|\n| `bpp` | Bytes per pixel |\n| `file_size_kb` | Dosya boyutu |\n| `width`, `height` | Boyutlar |\n| `total_pixels` | Toplam piksel |\n| `threshold` | Min BPP (0.1) |\n| `is_over_compressed` | true/false |\n| `valid` | Kalite geçti mi |\n| `reason` | \"over_compressed\" veya null |",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 280
      },
      "id": "sticky-response",
      "name": "Sticky Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [480, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### OK\nYeterli kalite",
        "height": 80,
        "width": 140,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-ok",
      "name": "Sticky OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1100, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Over-Compressed\nAşırı sıkıştırılmış",
        "height": 80,
        "width": 170,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "sticky-compressed",
      "name": "Sticky Compressed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1100, 120]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
